Z||000005||LarryB||06-21-2000||12:49 PM||||Fieros in the boneyards in Mass. are pretty rare and they've generally been pretty much picked over.  I want on a jihad this spring looking for a set of gold turbo wheels in Eastern MA without much luck.<P>IIRC the boneyard in Worcester off Rte. 20 had a blue Fiero with not-too-bad wheels and repairable grey seats (passenger seat was close to mint) still on it a couple of months ago.  <P>You might want to try calling Kick Hill in Connecticut as well, <A HREF="http://www.kickhill.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.kickhill.com</A>  ||||reg||1
