Z||000007||CUTTER||06-21-2000||05:38 PM||||I have 4 GT 15" wheels i will sell you. I will sell them to you for....well I was trying to get $200 for just the rims but I will sell them too you for $150 because of the shipping cost. if you want them let me know. They are in decent condition a few minor chips and 1 or 2 minor stains, but if you wash them and polish them up, from 5 feet away they look like new. I seen on one guys website he was selling his "fair" looking rims for $50 each, and mine are better then fair. I say mine are in good-great condition being they are 13 years old!<BR>E-mail me if you are interested....<BR>Thanks, Shane    oh yeah I live in PA||||reg||2
